OL,3,AFrance closes up to 500 schools Monday
OL,4,Aover student protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 500 schools across France will be
OL,7,Fpartially or totally closed on Monday
OL,8,Fafter clashes between riot police and
OL,9,Fstudent protesters in recent days, the
OL,10,FFrench education minister said on
OL,11,FSunday.
OL,13,FLessons will be "totally or partly
OL,14,Fsuspended" in some "400 to 500" high
OL,15,Fschools as security conditions "have
OL,16,Fnot been fulfilled", Edouard Geffray
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,FHe also said 24 schools had been
OL,20,F"burned or ransacked" since the start
OL,21,Fof the protests.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
