OL,3,AFrance closes up to 500 schools Monday
OL,4,Aover student protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of students have been
OL,7,Fdemonstrating over education standards
OL,8,Fand the protests, which started last
OL,9,Fweek, have spread from Paris to other
OL,10,Fcities, including Montpellier, Nantes
OL,11,Fand Marseille.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
